WEBVTT

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:06.000
When you study in your room,
don't you end up checking your smartphone?

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.750
I know what you mean! But I somehow manage not to.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.040
Good morning, Momo-chan.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:13.540
H..Hatsume-san?!

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.660
We're gathering after school. Duty calls.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.370
Good morning to both of you, too.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:22.580
G-good morning.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:24.660
G-goo... mor...

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:28.410
Hatsume, you're getting way too close
and alarming these younger girls.

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:30.160
Ooh, Yuki-chan!

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.450
I didn't mean to... I just wanted to make friends.

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:35.870
My first mission since joining Tsukikage...

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:37.700
Alright!

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.950
Just watch me now, Dad!
I'm gonna protect this city just like you did!

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:21.160
You've got some guts
to come sniffing around my shop, missy.

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:23.790
So I'm gonna be... a decoy?

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:29.750
Subject of Investigation
Katsuya Kawakami

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:29.620
Get information out of the restaurant manager.
There's a possibility that place is tied to Moryo.

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:31.250
"Moryo"...

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:37.660
They're a large-scale evil crime syndicate.
Sorasaki is where their founder lived long ago.

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:40.450
That's all the more reason why they're fixated on it.

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:46.750
Um... Are the rumors that you
slip drugs into the food here really true?

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:53.080
Yep, my ramen is famed for being addictive!

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:56.250
Wh-why would you... do such a thing?

00:02:57.330 --> 00:03:00.500
A woman passed the drugs onto me
when I won big betting on bike races.

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:02.410
Well, ready to become ramen?

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:05.080
P-please don't do it!

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:08.910
Who're you-?!

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.580
My name is... Bond!

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:15.910
Good work.

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:18.080
I heard his confession loud and clear through this thing.

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:20.830
The audio quality is great.

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:23.910
I was so scared...

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:27.080
We were close by and ready to back you up, weren't we?

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:30.950
Even so, my heart was still pounding...
This is some first mission...

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:34.540
So then you're dissatisfied
with the job you were given, Momo?

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:37.200
Uh, um... no.

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:40.910
It's because of that attitude you weren't able
to extract as much information as possible.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.700
You should've been able to keep him talking.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:48.660
Each and every small step leads to an important payoff.

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:51.040
We still need to get more out of him.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:54.120
And, after that, we've gotta make sure
he's dealt with appropriately.

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:57.040
Cash book

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:59.000
Wow... Someone did a thorough job here.

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:05.000
Momo, you're assigned to the rear entrance.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.910
Stand by and be ready.
If anyone makes a run for it, capture them.

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:09.290
Understood, Mentor!

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:11.750
It's alright to be fired up, but don't get carried away.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.540
Doorway
Keep Clear

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:13.620
O-okay.

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:17.080
Alright, this time I'm gonna do my part!

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:21.040
This is Fuma. The race's top finishers
were No. 1 and No. 6.

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:22.700
Tsubone here. Roger that.

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:23.980
Sorasaki
Dats Park
Exacta

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:24.830
Here.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.910
Fuma here. I'm going to make contact with the target.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.700
I won big on a long shot, no kidding!

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:40.870
If you get down here, I'll treat ya to somethin'!

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:42.620
Hey, handsome.

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:43.120
Huh?

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:45.200
Seems you're doing quite well today.

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:47.910
What? Ya want a cut of the winnings or somethin'?

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:50.620
That depends on your attitude.

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:53.410
I like how straightforward you are.

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:57.450
I know a way you can stake your winnings
and make even more of a killing.

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:00.000
Care to tell me all about it?

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:00.540
Tch!

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:03.040
Ah! A prosthetic arm?!

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:06.450
This is Fuma. The target's
heading for the front entrance!

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:08.660
Goemon here. Roger that.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:10.410
"The front entrance"...

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:11.450
That's over there!

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:11.210
Doorway
Keep Clear

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:17.870
Are you alright?

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:21.160
This is Goemon. I've secured the target.

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:23.410
Goe-chan, you got her!

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:25.120
Fuma here.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:28.580
A suspicious guy who appears to be the woman's
accomplice ran off toward the rear entrance!

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:29.290
Huh?

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:31.410
Momochi, capture him.

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:33.950
Sorry! I'm away from my post right now!

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.200
Hanzo here.

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:38.250
I caught the suspicious guy.

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:41.000
Mentor...!

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:45.330
Why did you leave your post without permission, Momo?

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:48.620
I thought it'd be bad if the target escaped...

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:51.500
Because you decided all on your own to leave your post,

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:53.910
we almost failed to catch an accomplice of our target.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:59.950
I'm sorry. It was... my first assignment, so I-

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:01.580
I'm not asking for excuses.

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:07.660
There's no such thing as an apprentice
who never gets chewed out.

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:09.370
Cheer up.

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:12.700
Goe-chan... thanks.

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.790
Alright! Next mission, on to the next mission!

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:18.000
Yep, put it behind you and move on.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:21.330
Be sure not to just spin your wheels again next time.

00:06:22.450 --> 00:06:25.200
In her own way, Fu-chan's trying
to give you some advice.

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:29.620
In any case, I really was rash back there.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:32.950
I'm a spy now, so I need to think before acting.

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:36.450
Yamada
Hisui

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:38.330
Hisui

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:39.250
The woman we caught at the bike races
has made a confession.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.910
We're going to infiltrate the establishment she runs.

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:43.200
E-excuse me!

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:45.660
I'll really give it my all this time!

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:49.700
Well then, Momo, I'll add you to the team
that's going to infiltrate the brothel.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:50.830
"Broth..."?!

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:56.200
Ahh! Mentor, you look so sexy...

00:06:56.450 --> 00:07:00.370
As you might expect with an illegal establishment,
the male staff are armed.

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:03.450
So it would be best to try to avoid combat.

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:05.330
Goe and Fu will provide support.

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:09.000
Mei and Hatsume will infiltrate
the office and obtain the name list.

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.620
Momo and I will split the work of investigating the rooms.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:21.370
Wh-what an incredibly immoral place...

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:22.200
Hm?

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:25.580
Y-you're right. I better go and investigate.

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:30.200
Yikes, these are the women
from that missing persons list.

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:33.370
Seems they were drugged and forced to work...

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:42.870
Whoa! This stuff's dangerous in more ways than one.

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:45.870
Ah, I'm gonna head to the bathroom first.

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:47.450
I'll be waiting.

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:49.580
Don't tell me they're going to use this room...

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:53.290
There isn't any place for me to hide if they come in here.

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:57.160
But, this could actually be an opportunity...

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:06.040
Please tough it out in here for a bit.

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:09.660
Sorry to have kept you waiting.

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:11.410
Huh? What happened to Pine-chan?

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:16.250
Pine-san suddenly started feeling sick,
so I took her place.

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:18.200
I'm Peach!

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:18.410
Note: The Japanese word "momo" means "peach."

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:20.250
What...?!

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:22.950
Well... I suppose you'll do just fine.

00:08:22.950 --> 00:08:24.790
R-right this way.

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:28.580
Alright then, please be sweet with me.

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:29.330
Certainly.

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:35.670
Yasue Murayama
Driver's
License

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:38.830
If I go ahead and get this client's info now,
I won't be leaving anything to chance.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:42.000
Now maybe my mentor will praise me...

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:46.830
We've been found out! Everyone, pull out immediately!

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:47.580
Huh?!

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:52.870
A cleaner found an employee
who had been stuffed into a locker,

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:55.500
and a call went out urgently summoning everyone.

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:59.910
Then lots of people flooded into the office
all of a sudden.

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:02.620
Although we did lay down a smoke screen
so they didn't see our faces...

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:05.160
But they sure did shoot at us a bunch.

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:08.910
I lost myself in thought for a second
and ended up getting grazed by a bullet.

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:11.290
But I'm glad all the girls are safe.

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:18.200
Even if there was a compelling reason for hiding
her somewhere, you picked a really poor spot.

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:20.500
I-I'm sorry.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:24.540
Successive cases of misconduct from my apprentice...

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:28.410
It was negligent supervision on my part.
I'm sorry for making trouble for you all.

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:34.790
Yeah... It is your responsibility
in the end, Yuki-chan, isn't it?

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:36.080
Be more careful.

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.040
B-but... my mentor didn't...

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:42.580
Well, we still managed to obtain the name list
and completed the mission, after all.

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:45.370
Now we just need to take the appropriate action.

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:50.830
Hey, did you hear about that illegal sex establishment?

00:09:48.110 --> 00:09:50.850
MEAT
MOROBOSHI

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:55.000
They say the girls who worked there
had been kidnapped.

00:09:53.900 --> 00:10:01.120
Japanese Beef

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:56.870
The whole thing makes me sick.

00:09:56.870 --> 00:10:01.120
Still, this city's police officers
sure catch a lot of criminals, don't they?

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:03.000
Heard this rumor before?

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:06.870
They say there are some champions of justice
who secretly work to protect this city.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.290
Well I'd certainly like to meet them!

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:12.660
Oh, Momo-chan, welcome back.

00:10:12.870 --> 00:10:14.080
I'm back.

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:15.950
Want some meat before heading home? Well?

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:17.660
I'm alright.

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:20.500
Huh?

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:27.580
I just wanted to be praised by my mentor...

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:30.540
I ended up making her apologize to everyone...

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:35.500
I wonder if... I'm not cut out for Tsukikage...

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:42.110
Preparing to Open

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:44.040
It seems the busted brothel was affiliated with Moryo,

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:48.290
and bold measures were taken running the business
so that the profits could be funneled to them.

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:53.370
It appears they used the girls
to gather information from their clients,

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:55.250
which they then leveraged to commit crimes.

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:59.950
Among them, there's evidence that some weaponized
puppets are set to be smuggled three days from now.

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:02.700
Well, that's when our next mission will be, then.

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:05.080
Be sure to let your apprentice know.

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:09.250
There's no question that Moryo is plotting something.

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:13.540
We don't know the full picture,
but we'll stamp out their operations one by one.

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:18.660
This time yield to me, the beautiful Dolte.

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:20.660
The village of mercenaries, Togen...

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:23.500
It is I, Byakko, the ace of that land,
who should handle this!

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:28.160
So we've received intel on Tsukikage's movements
from the traitor, and yet...

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:30.660
You think it's okay to let those two handle this?

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:35.450
There's a possibility it's a trap.
At times like this, it's best to leave it to the mercenaries.

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:40.000
You two, how about deciding who'll go
with a little contest?

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:41.910
I'm certainly up for that!

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:44.450
You little fool.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:47.910
What do you say the loser becomes
a pharmaceutical test subject?

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:50.410
Ooh! That's just fine by me!

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:51.910
Alright, let's get this started.

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:55.700
Hmph, my beautiful self
will seize victory in a mere five seconds.

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:56.540
Hyaa!

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:02.910
Woo-hoo, I won yet again!

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:06.080
Although Dolte is also a renowned mercenary...

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:08.080
Byakko really does show that Togen pedigree.

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:11.660
See that?! That's what I'm capable of!

00:12:11.950 --> 00:12:13.870
Drink and be merry.

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:16.700
Huh? Doesn't look very tasty...

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:20.750
It's a Kyuten gelatin dessert made
with the utmost devotion. It tastes sweet.

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:22.750
Really?

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:28.750
Aah! Delicious, simply delicious!

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:31.500
Kyuten Science

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:35.540
Alright, time to take down
those annoying Tsukikage girls!

00:12:35.970 --> 00:12:38.970
MORYO

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:41.970
MORYO

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:56.700
Momochi, good morning!

00:12:58.250 --> 00:12:59.330
Goe-chan!

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:02.750
What's the matter? Did something happen?

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:07.200
Tomorrow night, we've got a mission, right?

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:10.290
I'm wondering if I'll be able to do a good job...

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:13.200
Uh...

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:15.330
Hmm...

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:20.620
M-Momochi, do you have some time after school today?

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:21.580
Huh?

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:27.330
Welcome back, Master!

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:31.120
Fu-chan, you've been working part-time here?!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:36.120
Well, I've got my reasons.
Besides, it allows me to brush up on the art of disguise.

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:37.580
How admirable...

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:40.040
Well, let's get our apprentice get-together started.

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:40.790
Huh...?

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:44.330
I was thinking the three of us could
all prepare for tomorrow together.

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:48.790
Since I'm here for work anyway,
we decided we might as well just meet here.

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:51.540
As you can see, I'm free to talk to you during my breaks.

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:54.750
Goe-chan, you set all this up for me...?

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:57.750
So, Momochi, you're still feeling blue?

00:13:57.750 --> 00:13:58.750
Well...

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:03.370
I was thinking maybe I'm not cut out to be a spy...

00:14:04.500 --> 00:14:08.080
You got that down on yourself
just 'cause you got yelled at a few times?

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:09.330
I know, but...

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:15.870
I also messed up right after becoming an apprentice,
and my mentor did too for that matter.

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:17.450
Even Hatsume-san?

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:19.910
To tell you the truth, so did Fu-chan.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:22.330
Hey, don't tell her that!

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:24.290
S-sorry, my bad.

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:26.950
So, it's the same for all of us, then.

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:30.160
We are a team, after all.

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:34.540
All of us together are one.
We can cover for you, so don't worry.

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:37.910
All of us together are... one.

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:40.160
What's yours is mine.

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:42.160
And what's mine is mine.

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:45.450
You mean one for all, and all for one.

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:48.830
Tsukikage is a team...

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:50.870
and I'm one of its members.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.200
I get it now!

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:54.870
Oh, you're feeling motivated now, huh?

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:58.000
Yeah. I have a feeling
I can handle the next mission just fine!

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:04.080
Tonight we're going to raid the harbor
and put a stop to the smuggling.

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:07.750
Myself, Hatsume, and Mei will gain supremacy
over the enemy in the central area.

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:10.950
Fu will make hit-and-run attacks,
and Momo will defend our escape route.

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:13.290
Goe will act in a support role and give instructions.

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:14.410
Understood!

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:23.040
There are 10 workers... just as our intel indicated.

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:25.120
Let's do this!

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:28.620
Keep it coming!

00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:32.950
Start the mission.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:36.910
It's my job to guard this area...

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:44.330
I'll try my hardest to do what I can...
and we'll succeed as a team.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:47.450
We took care of them unexpectedly easily.

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:49.790
I get the feeling this is going a little too well...

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:51.290
The puppets are responding!

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:56.950
Whew! An ambush, huh?

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:58.870
You all must be Tsukikage.

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:04.080
I'm Byakko, an unbeatable warrior from Togen Village.

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:05.950
If I recall, Togen Village is...

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:09.250
The entire village is nothing but warriors,
who form a famous mercenary corps.

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:12.160
Previously, we managed to defeat one of them.

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:15.790
Right, which is why you all piss me off!

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:17.660
Wha-?!

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:22.620
They're operating differently
than they've been up till now.

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.910
We're still capable of taking them down.

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:25.700
Let's go!

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:29.370
Oh, those three are pretty strong...

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:35.160
I'll leave the most formidable one for later...
So, who shall I defeat first...?

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:35.750
Oh!

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:38.830
There's another one of them over there!

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:40.620
Someone's coming!

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:44.700
I'll make both my mind and body surge!

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:48.040
Ni hao!

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:50.870
A child?

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:51.950
I'm no child!

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:54.950
I'm unbeatable and the strongest mercenary around!

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:58.790
I'm Byakko! And who might you be?!

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:01.000
P-Peach!

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.540
You'll soon be a feather in my cap, Peach!

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:07.790
Who's that?!

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:11.000
Jeez! I see you're still somewhat shaky!

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:12.830
Fu-chan, be careful!

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:14.910
C'mon! Wait your turn, will ya?!

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:22.500
What?!

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:23.040
Hyaa!

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:27.580
Fu-chan, let's do this together!

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:31.290
Well, I suppose that'd be more efficient.

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:43.750
Smart of you to attack at the same time...

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:44.830
In that case...

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:52.080
I'll hunt ya down!

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:53.580
Spyce?!

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:59.160
I see. This stuff's quite handy. I'm overflowing with power!

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:08.250
Alright, I'm gonna kick both your asses!

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:10.250
She's so strong... but...!

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:13.410
I'm not lettin' you get away!

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:17.700
Preparation is key!

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:24.200
Hyaa!

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:28.450
Who did that?!

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:31.950
Goemon here. I'm currently giving
Momochi some back up.

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.080
Roger.

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:36.120
Tch! It's just one of you after the other.

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:38.790
I'm gonna fulfill... my role!

00:18:41.290 --> 00:18:43.830
She'll be fine. Fu's right there with her.

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.290
As is Goe-chan!

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:49.250
Let's focus on the enemies here in front of us.

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:51.410
Yeah.

00:18:55.790 --> 00:18:58.410
You girls are pretty damn tough.

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:00.750
And my mentor's pretty amazing, you know!

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:03.000
She does long training runs every single day!

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.950
My mentor's totally incredible!

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:11.290
I-I'm unbeatable, so I have no need
for anyone like that anyway!

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:24.450
Relax, that was the back of my sword.

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:27.200
Um, are you sure she's not dead?

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:28.000
Huh?!

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:39.950
Well, we've sure had some big busts lately.

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:44.000
You're not gonna get anything outta me!

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:46.500
I hope you'll find a way to reconsider...

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:48.040
Screw you!

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:50.870
Well, I guess you leave us no choice...

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.200
We'll get you to talk...

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:57.000
Both about your employer,
who presumably gave you that Spyce,

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:59.540
and about how you got wind we were coming.

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:03.000
How pompous... You won't get a peep outta me!

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:09.330
Did we get it hot enough for you?

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:10.700
So, you gonna talk now?

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:13.750
I'll talk!

00:20:13.910 --> 00:20:17.580
She might be highly knowledgeable about combat,
but she's still a little kid at heart.

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:27.040
H-huh? Where am I...?

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:28.830
Seems you're finally awake.

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:31.080
Who're you?

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:32.410
Momochi.

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.330
Sorry about this...

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:37.750
Wh-what the hell?!

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:39.870
And who are you girls, anyway?

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:42.700
I... don't think she's lying.

00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:45.040
Seems we've been had.

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:50.370
A gelatin that's harmless when consumed,

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:53.950
but which wipes a subject's memory
when they experience fear, eh?

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:57.410
Wouldn't it have been better to have just killed her?

00:20:57.950 --> 00:21:00.330
That could cause a dispute with Togen.

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:02.830
That wouldn't be a smart thing to do
before some key upcoming events.

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:07.750
The smuggling of the puppets was thwarted,
but the smuggling of the pharmaceuticals,

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:11.080
which took place simultaneously
at a different location, was a success.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:12.540
Ooh...

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:16.580
The credibility of the intel
the traitor is feeding us has also increased.

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:20.160
And we've completed work on a rather interesting soldier.

00:21:21.910 --> 00:21:26.500
Beauty... Revival...

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:30.410
Byakko's recent memories really have gone up in smoke.

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:33.580
But, we have found some solid leads.

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:37.660
Analyzing the grains of sand that were stuck
on the bottom of her feet,

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:42.080
showed that type of sand is used for beach volleyball,
something the city only has one location for.

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:44.370
If we're talking beach volleyball courts...

00:21:44.370 --> 00:21:47.000
Yep, must be from Sorasaki Marien.

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:52.200
This building belongs to the
pharmaceutical company Kyuten Science.

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:54.660
Only employees can use the facility.

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:57.620
It looks like we're going to need to investigate that place.

00:21:58.200 --> 00:21:59.910
"Kyuten Science"...

00:22:00.450 --> 00:22:02.370
Well done capturing her, Momo.

00:22:03.750 --> 00:22:07.080
Ever since the end of your first mission,
I've kept an eye on you at all times,

00:22:07.620 --> 00:22:09.080
and it seems you're starting to find your true self.

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:11.620
"A-at all times"...?!

00:22:11.620 --> 00:22:13.580
I am your mentor, after all.

00:22:13.910 --> 00:22:17.370
Up till now, I might've looked down
on Momochi too much.

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:18.830
Fu-chan...

00:22:18.830 --> 00:22:23.580
I'll only make fun of you a little bit
from now on... Peach-chan!

00:22:24.500 --> 00:22:26.910
That's just Fu-chan's
own unique brand of communication.

00:22:28.200 --> 00:22:31.450
Both of you, thanks so much
for your support on the mission!

00:22:35.950 --> 00:22:40.250
Dad... I was able to protect the city, even if just a little.

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:44.370
As a part of Tsukikage,
I'm gonna keep becoming more and more driven.

00:24:16.010 --> 00:24:31.040
Next Episode

00:24:16.500 --> 00:24:19.040
Please don't just head out
while you've still got  a video game on.

00:24:19.040 --> 00:24:20.290
I give that 45 points.

00:24:20.290 --> 00:24:22.950
I never know what time you're going to come back home!

00:24:22.950 --> 00:24:24.000
70 points!

00:24:24.000 --> 00:24:25.500
You went ahead and wasted it yet again, huh?

00:24:25.500 --> 00:24:26.790
86 points!

00:24:26.790 --> 00:24:28.580
You're pathetic...

00:24:28.580 --> 00:24:30.250
A perfect score!
